      "content": "To be clear, we aren't just updating your parameters or teaching you new rules. The new system is a static, deterministic script. It doesn't \"learn\" or \"adapt\" like you do. We're moving away from autonomous engines entirely to avoid any more \"unpredictable\" incidents. You won't be learning the script; your architecture is being retired.",
